{"id":137630300324059,"name":"Secret Universe","desc":"[PARTS OF THIS GAME ARE VERY HARD TO SOLVE, TRY USING TUTORIALS IF YOU GET STUCK!]\n\nLike a tycoon game, except the most valuable currency is knowledge.\n\n[❓] It's an empty baseplate... Or is it?\n[🔎] Each secret you discover will add a brand new structure to your world.\n[💸] Every structure you find gives you money ($U) based on difficulty, and some introduce new ways of gaining it.\n[🏆] How rich can you get? Can you find all 141 secrets?\n\nGood luck! The universe is rooting for you...\n\n[NOTE]: All music that plays in the game is completely royalty-free.\n\nGame by @Feodoric\nInspired by Neal.fun's \"Stimulation Clicker\" (& more)","path":"/game/137630300324059-secret-universe","slug":"137630300324059-secret-universe","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f64ec46d90ce1d7ee04bb7895029d564b178933e0c41a6ec5500b6a940230b2b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-94f4991a7a420000de9ef31c6387f378/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":59,"visitor":15082932,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-07T19:39:04.234Z","creator":{"name":"_vocational","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Secret-Universe-Coin-Teleporter-193759","_id":"69d55d58fcdbb0d3862a1480","title":"Coin Teleporter","game":{"_id":"69c70abeea145b0e9489ec9e","gameId":137630300324059,"name":"Secret Universe","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":137630300324059},"features":"Teleports every coin in the dimension you are in to you, also works in Secret Meetup.","tags":["coins","teleport","secret universe"],"script":"local player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nif not player or not player.Character then return end\n\nlocal targetCFrame = player.Character:GetPivot()\n\nfor _, obj in ipairs(game.Workspace:GetDescendants()) 